NCT07787884.eligibility_criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* (1) Meet the current Chinese criteria for older adults, aged ≥60 years;

  (2) Clinically diagnosed with diabetic foot (DF);

  (3) Voluntarily agree to participate in this study after being informed of the study purpose by the researcher.

Exclusion Criteria:

* (1) Severe cognitive impairment or mental disorders: patients definitively diagnosed with Parkinson's disease, senile dementia, or severe depression by a Class II-A or higher hospital; or those with a score below 9 on the Mini-Mental State Examination (MMSE) indicating severe cognitive impairment;

  (2) Severe communication impairment: patients unable to communicate normally with others due to hearing impairment, speech impairment, or other related conditions;

  (3) Patients unable to complete the questionnaire survey for any reason;

  (4) Patients currently participating in other trials that may affect the results of this study.

NCT07748884.eligibility_criteria:
